# npm's ignore list. Present so npm does NOT fall back to .gitignore.
#
# The rules below mirror .gitignore on purpose: npm-packlist uses .gitignore only
# when this file is absent, so dropping it in without copying the rules would
# start shipping anything .gitignore was keeping out (local notes, scratch
# scripts, model weights). Keep the two files in sync when editing either.
#
# The one addition is `!web/dist`: the built memory-browser bundle. Git ignores it
# (see .gitignore) but the tarball has to carry it -- the plugin serves it on
# 127.0.0.1:4747 and a package without it installs fine and then has no page.

ANALYSIS.txt
models/
node_modules/
*.tgz
memory/
MEMORY.md
DREAMS.md
AGENTS.md
SOUL.md
IDENTITY.md
USER.md
BOOTSTRAP.md
training/
serve-test.log
serve-test.err
*.log
probe-binding.mjs
diag.mjs
meta.mjs
raw.mjs
fewshot.mjs
t.mjs
t2.mjs
t3.mjs
m2.mjs
m3.mjs
*.txt
TODO.md
VERIFY.md

# Built page bundle: gitignored, shipped.
!web/dist
!web/dist/**